⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of D-503
node WE1 · WE1 · ⟦D-503:WE1:2bf563⟧

WHO   — D-503 — the mathematician with a soul
WHAT  — The narrator infected by individuality: he grows dreams, desire, and a ‘soul,’ and is finally cured of them by the Operation.
WHERE — WE1 · WE  Framework inputs: We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the warning needs a perfect citizen who catches the disease of being a person — and is surgically restored.
HOW   — By a journal, an affair with I-330, and an imagination the State diagnoses as illness, then removes.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I built the ship to carry our perfect happiness to the stars — then caught a soul, and they cut it out, and I watched her tortured and felt nothing.

